    "0062cd47-4380-4953-849a-812431e45ba4": {"id":"0062cd47-4380-4953-849a-812431e45ba4","project_id":48873,"key":237981561,"version":null,"meta":{},"children":[],"deleted_at":null,"created_at":"2025-08-21T04:31:14.285Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T04:31:14.285Z","props":{"useBackgroundControls":true,"content":"\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003ch2 data-type=\"heading-two\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eStudent Practice:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eMoving the Elephant in a Square Path\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003eIn this section, students will be given exercises to \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003edo on their own\u003c/strong\u003e, with \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eminimal assistance\u003c/strong\u003e from teachers. If they have any questions, feel free to provide them \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eguiding questions\u003c/strong\u003e, but please \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003erefrain from giving them the answer\u003c/strong\u003e as they will be \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003egraded on their individual exercises\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","className":"","enableTextToSpeechBtn":true},"type":"Text"}, 
