    "824da660-ee35-4132-831e-7d7d0692fcf9": {"id":"824da660-ee35-4132-831e-7d7d0692fcf9","project_id":48873,"key":237981546,"version":null,"meta":{},"children":[],"deleted_at":null,"created_at":"2025-08-21T04:31:08.219Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T04:31:08.219Z","props":{"useBackgroundControls":true,"content":"\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003ch2 data-type=\"heading-two\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eTeacher-Led Practice:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eMaking the Ball Move Up and Down When Clicked\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003eIn this section, students will learn how to use \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003edifferent types of \u0026quot;Move\u0026quot; blocks\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e to \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003econtrol object movement\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e in various directions. Teachers will \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003eprovide students with the instructions\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e and are encouraged to \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003edo the exercise together with the students\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e▶️ \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eNote for Educators\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003eIn this section, we will provide materials for \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003eboth students as well as educators\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e to use. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003eOnly provide your students the sections tagged “For Students”\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e and use the sections tagged \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e“For Teacher” to help guide the students\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family:Poppins\" data-type=\"fontFamily\"\u003e in the classroom.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","className":"","enableTextToSpeechBtn":true},"type":"Text"}, 
