    "cfdd199a-3acf-4c36-a89a-93334d065f71": {"id":"cfdd199a-3acf-4c36-a89a-93334d065f71","project_id":48873,"key":232124961,"version":null,"meta":{},"children":[],"deleted_at":null,"created_at":"2025-08-06T09:05:34.010Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T09:05:34.010Z","props":{"content":"\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003eNext, click the \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e“Events”\u003c/strong\u003e menu. In this menu, you’ll find different \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003ecode blocks\u003c/strong\u003e that work as triggers to start an interaction. For this example, we will be using \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e“When Elephant is clicked”\u003c/strong\u003e to make the elephant move when it is clicked, but there are many other \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e“Events”\u003c/strong\u003e blocks that can be used. We will go through each one in more detail in \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eCourse 2\u003c/strong\u003e, but feel free to explore them on \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eyour own\u003c/strong\u003e for now if you wish!\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","className":"text-align-center","enableTextToSpeechBtn":true},"type":"Text"}, 
    "4bb20a39-c5fe-4e1b-84b4-977d776c1e45": {"id":"4bb20a39-c5fe-4e1b-84b4-977d776c1e45","project_id":48873,"key":232124786,"version":null,"meta":{},"children":[],"deleted_at":null,"created_at":"2025-08-06T09:02:10.873Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T09:02:10.873Z","props":{"content":"\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003eNow you’re ready to publish! \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eClick the “Publish” button\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e▶️ \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eNote\u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003eIf you want to \u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eupdate your project after publishing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e, don’t worry you can! Simply reopen your project and continue where you left off. Once you’re done, \u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003efollow the same steps\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e that you did just now to refresh your project and republish it!\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-left\" data-type=\"textAlignLeft\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"css-1hic8sc-rules\" style=\"color:#1428a0\" data-type=\"color\"\u003e📱\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"css-1hic8sc-rules\" style=\"color:#1428a0\" data-type=\"color\"\u003eSamsung Galaxy Tips\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan class=\"css-1hic8sc-rules\" style=\"color:#1428a0\" data-type=\"color\"\u003e: \u003c/span\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"css-1hic8sc-rules\" style=\"color:#1428a0\" data-type=\"color\"\u003eAfter each course, have students use Samsung Notes to draw or write their reflections with the stylus as part of their \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"css-1hic8sc-rules\" style=\"color:#1428a0\" data-type=\"color\"\u003einteractive reflection journal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","className":"text-align-center","enableTextToSpeechBtn":true},"type":"Text"}, 
    "f49cc1e2-edec-40e1-9e6d-95637b092cde": {"id":"f49cc1e2-edec-40e1-9e6d-95637b092cde","project_id":48873,"key":232124148,"version":null,"meta":{},"children":[],"deleted_at":null,"created_at":"2025-08-06T08:55:27.677Z","updated_at":"2025-08-06T08:55:27.677Z","props":{"content":"\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003eNext, select “\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eDefault Editor\u003c/strong\u003e”. With this editor, you can use various exciting features to create a project that’s more complex, creative, and interactive! On the other hand, you can use the \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eSuper Simple Editor\u003c/strong\u003e when you want to create something more \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003esimple\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003equick\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","className":"text-align-center","enableTextToSpeechBtn":true},"type":"Text"}, 
