    "1fb23026-7aa0-40b1-b07c-291c98a799cc": {"id":"1fb23026-7aa0-40b1-b07c-291c98a799cc","project_id":48873,"key":226469438,"version":null,"meta":{},"children":[],"deleted_at":null,"created_at":"2025-07-22T07:32:34.937Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T07:32:34.937Z","props":{"content":"\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eChange the project title to “Tiger”\u003c/strong\u003e. You can name your project based on what it does.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-left\" data-type=\"textAlignLeft\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"chameleon-text-align-center\" data-type=\"textAlignCenter\"\u003e\u003cp data-type=\"paragraph\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003e💡\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003eTip\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e: You can \u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003erotate the camera by holding the left mouse button\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e and dragging it left or right. Additionally, you can \u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-type=\"bold\"\u003echange the camera position by holding the right mouse button\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003cem data-type=\"italic\"\u003e and dragging it left or right.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","className":"text-align-center","enableTextToSpeechBtn":true},"type":"Text"}, 
